  "about": "NPC number and text input (issue #449): each opens a box of its own at (392, 320) at 1024x768, the number one 176x46 with \"Input number \" and \"0\" in its field, the text one 346x46 and empty; Esc does nothing; typing 25 and Enter sends 25; OK with an empty text field sends nothing and the box stays. The NPC (npc/input.txt) is loaded with @loadnpc and unloaded at both ends.",
